{{#section "subject"}}
A Passkey Was Removed From Your Arcus Account
{{/section}}

{{#section "plaintext-body"}}
Hi {{{_person.firstName}}},

A passkey named "{{{passkeyName}}}" was removed from your Arcus account,
and it can no longer be used to log in. If you removed it, please
disregard this email.

If you did not remove it, your account may have been compromised.
Change your password, which signs you out everywhere else, and check
your passkeys under Settings > Profile. If you can't log in, use
Forgot Password.
{{/section}}

{{#section "html-body"}}

	{{#partial "greeting" }}
	Hi {{ _person.firstName }},
	{{/partial}}

	{{#partial "message" }}
	<p>A passkey named "{{passkeyName}}" was removed from your Arcus account, and it can no longer be used to log in. If you removed it, please disregard this email.</p>
	<p/>
	<p>If you did not remove it, your account may have been compromised. Change your password, which signs you out everywhere else, and check your passkeys under Settings &gt; Profile. If you can't log in, use Forgot Password.</p>
	{{/partial}}

{{#partial "extra" }}
	{{/partial}}

{{> layout-html-email}}
{{/section}}
